  "title": "Scientists Reportedly Hiding AI Text Prompts in Academic Papers to Receive Positive Peer Reviews",
  "summary": "Some scientists are reportedly embedding hidden AI prompts in academic papers to influence automated or AI-assisted peer reviews toward more positive feedback. These concealed instructions raise concerns about transparency, ethics, and the integrity of the research review process. The issue highlights growing challenges as AI becomes more involved in academic publishing and evaluation.",
